SCOPE

This licence covers the source code in this repository: the application, its
components, styles, scripts and configuration.

It does NOT cover the written content or figures — the files under `content/`
and the images under `public/`, including the research write-ups, log entries,
the CV, and the research figures. Those remain © 2026 Alabi Emmanuel Olasubomi,
all rights reserved, and are published here to be read rather than reused.

Research code and data are licensed separately in their own repositories; the
archived datasets carry their own terms at their DOIs.
